1. Resets the global state to ensure a clean starting point
2. Creates the `GlobalStateSnapshot` struct to store all the state checks
3. Captures the state before any guards are created (should all be false/inactive)
4. Creates a `RegFunGuard` in a scope block with a lambda callback
5. Checks if dependency tracking is active inside the guard scope (should be true)
